%description:
Tests a lost probe of the path MTU search (mtuProbing = 2) with TcpNewReno without
SACK, which starts the fast retransmit of RFC 6582 recovery. The scenario is that of
tcp_mtu_probe_2: the probe of MTU 1263 is dropped (B040), and at the third
duplicate ACK only the probe is lost. The search continues below it, and the
probe goes again as segments of the MSS (B056, B057), without a congestion
response, so the next probe (MTU 1144) follows, as in tcp_mtu_probe_2.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 60000"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 600
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 2
*.srv_tcp.baseMss = 512
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500
*.tcptester.pathMtu = 1100
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = false
*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpNewReno"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.021 B040] A.1000 < B.2000: A 23687:24910(1223) ack 1 win 16384 # dropping, larger than the path MTU
[1.021 B041] A.1000 < B.2000: A 24910:25896(986) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is acknowledged, snd_mss is 986
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1263 is lost, the search runs from 1026 to 1262
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the lost MTU probe goes again as segments of the MSS, without a congestion response
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.025 B056] A.1000 < B.2000: A 23687:24673(986) ack 1 win 16384 
[1.025 B057] A.1000 < B.2000: A 24673:24910(237) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1144 is lost, the search runs from 1026 to 1143
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
snd_mss is 1223
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
